{"id":"algli","name":"Algli","type":"character","aliases":[],"description":"Surviving cultist who helped Liesa hunt the demon and pledged herself to Liesa.","pages":4,"first_seen":"2021-10-01","last_seen":"2021-10-01","description_citations":[{"source":"mtg-wiki","official":false,"publisher":"MTG Wiki contributors","work":"Liesa","series":"MTG Wiki","authors":[],"date":"","url":"https://mtg.wiki/page/Liesa","link":"https://mtg.wiki/page/Liesa","archived":null,"license":"CC BY-NC-SA 4.0, MTG Wiki contributors","text":"\"Liesa\". MTG Wiki contributors, CC BY-NC-SA 4.0, MTG Wiki contributors."}],"bio":null,"timeline":[{"id":"dusk-reborn-2021-10-01-e0","era":null,"summary":"Algli's husband and sons die in a ghoul attack on the family tannery, and she survives by setting the tannery aflame.","participants":["algli"],"location":"innistrad","importance":"major","page":"stories/dusk-reborn-2021-10-01","order":760,"story_date":"2021-10-01","storyline":"Innistrad: Crimson Vow","source":"wizards","paragraph":4,"quote":"Her husband and her youngest son threw themselves between her and the ghouls, and she set the tannery aflame.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/dusk-reborn-2021-10-01#:~:text=Her%20husband%20and%20her,set%20the%20tannery%20aflame.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Dusk Reborn","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Rhiannon Rasmussen"],"date":"2021-10-01","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/dusk-reborn-2021-10-01","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/dusk-reborn-2021-10-01#:~:text=Her%20husband%20and%20her,set%20the%20tannery%20aflame.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Dusk Reborn\" by Rhiannon Rasmussen. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 1 Oct 2021."}},{"id":"dusk-reborn-2021-10-01-e1","era":null,"summary":"A ghoulcaller raises Algli's dead family; she meets Olutio and together they slay him, and Olutio first speaks to her of the Buried Lord.","participants":["algli","olutio","the-buried-lord"],"location":"innistrad","importance":"major","page":"stories/dusk-reborn-2021-10-01","order":760,"story_date":"2021-10-01","storyline":"Innistrad: Crimson Vow","source":"wizards","paragraph":8,"quote":"Standing over their fresh graves, Olutio first spoke to her of the Buried Lord.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/dusk-reborn-2021-10-01#:~:text=Standing%20over%20their%20fresh,of%20the%20Buried%20Lord.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Dusk Reborn","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Rhiannon Rasmussen"],"date":"2021-10-01","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/dusk-reborn-2021-10-01","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/dusk-reborn-2021-10-01#:~:text=Standing%20over%20their%20fresh,of%20the%20Buried%20Lord.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Dusk Reborn\" by Rhiannon Rasmussen. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 1 Oct 2021."}},{"id":"dusk-reborn-2021-10-01-e2","era":null,"summary":"The three cultists perform the last ritual in the clearing with a goat, but nothing seems to happen.","participants":["algli","olutio","sruta","the-buried-lord-s-cult"],"location":"innistrad","importance":"minor","page":"stories/dusk-reborn-2021-10-01","order":760,"story_date":"2021-10-01","storyline":"Innistrad: Crimson Vow","source":"wizards","paragraph":14,"quote":"A goat, hooves and horns, in the image of a demon.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/dusk-reborn-2021-10-01#:~:text=A%20goat%2C%20hooves%20and,image%20of%20a%20demon.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Dusk Reborn","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Rhiannon Rasmussen"],"date":"2021-10-01","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/dusk-reborn-2021-10-01","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/dusk-reborn-2021-10-01#:~:text=A%20goat%2C%20hooves%20and,image%20of%20a%20demon.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Dusk Reborn\" by Rhiannon Rasmussen. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 1 Oct 2021."}},{"id":"dusk-reborn-2021-10-01-e3","era":null,"summary":"Sruta calls Olutio and Algli fools and leaves, and Olutio follows, leaving Algli alone with her despair.","participants":["sruta","olutio","algli"],"location":"innistrad","importance":"minor","page":"stories/dusk-reborn-2021-10-01","order":760,"story_date":"2021-10-01","storyline":"Innistrad: Crimson Vow","source":"wizards","paragraph":18,"quote":"\"You were always a fool, Olutio,\" she said.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/dusk-reborn-2021-10-01#:~:text=%22You%20were%20always%20a%20fool%2C%20Olutio%2C%22%20she%20said.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Dusk Reborn","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Rhiannon Rasmussen"],"date":"2021-10-01","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/dusk-reborn-2021-10-01","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/dusk-reborn-2021-10-01#:~:text=%22You%20were%20always%20a%20fool%2C%20Olutio%2C%22%20she%20said.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Dusk Reborn\" by Rhiannon Rasmussen. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 1 Oct 2021."}},{"id":"dusk-reborn-2021-10-01-e4","era":null,"summary":"Algli finds a wounded angel behind her who says she is compelled to answer the call and that the Buried Lord is hungry.","participants":["algli","liesa"],"location":"innistrad","importance":"major","page":"stories/dusk-reborn-2021-10-01","order":760,"story_date":"2021-10-01","storyline":"Innistrad: Crimson Vow","source":"wizards","paragraph":29,"quote":"\"But the Buried Lord has never been one to protect. He is here, and he is hungry.\"","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/dusk-reborn-2021-10-01#:~:text=%22But%20the%20Buried%20Lord,and%20he%20is%20hungry.%22","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Dusk Reborn","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Rhiannon Rasmussen"],"date":"2021-10-01","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/dusk-reborn-2021-10-01","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/dusk-reborn-2021-10-01#:~:text=%22But%20the%20Buried%20Lord,and%20he%20is%20hungry.%22","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Dusk Reborn\" by Rhiannon Rasmussen. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 1 Oct 2021."}},{"id":"dusk-reborn-2021-10-01-e5","era":null,"summary":"Algli bandages Liesa's wound and tells her about the Travails and the fall of the angels.","participants":["algli","liesa"],"location":"innistrad","importance":"minor","page":"stories/dusk-reborn-2021-10-01","order":760,"story_date":"2021-10-01","storyline":"Innistrad: Crimson Vow","source":"wizards","paragraph":48,"quote":"Algli bandaged the angel's ribs firmly","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/dusk-reborn-2021-10-01#:~:text=Algli%20bandaged%20the%20angel%27s%20ribs%20firmly","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Dusk Reborn","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Rhiannon Rasmussen"],"date":"2021-10-01","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/dusk-reborn-2021-10-01","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/dusk-reborn-2021-10-01#:~:text=Algli%20bandaged%20the%20angel%27s%20ribs%20firmly","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Dusk Reborn\" by Rhiannon Rasmussen. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 1 Oct 2021."}},{"id":"dusk-reborn-2021-10-01-e6","era":null,"summary":"Liesa introduces herself as an archangel who once led the Flight of Dusk and asks Algli to help her rebury the Buried Lord.","participants":["liesa","algli","flight-of-dusk"],"location":"innistrad","importance":"major","page":"stories/dusk-reborn-2021-10-01","order":760,"story_date":"2021-10-01","storyline":"Innistrad: Crimson Vow","source":"wizards","paragraph":50,"quote":"\"I am Liesa, archangel who once lead the Flight of Dusk.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/dusk-reborn-2021-10-01#:~:text=%22I%20am%20Liesa%2C%20archangel,the%20Flight%20of%20Dusk.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Dusk Reborn","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Rhiannon Rasmussen"],"date":"2021-10-01","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/dusk-reborn-2021-10-01","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/dusk-reborn-2021-10-01#:~:text=%22I%20am%20Liesa%2C%20archangel,the%20Flight%20of%20Dusk.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Dusk Reborn\" by Rhiannon Rasmussen. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 1 Oct 2021."}},{"id":"dusk-reborn-2021-10-01-e7","era":null,"summary":"Liesa and Algli find Olutio's gutted body.","participants":["liesa","algli","olutio"],"location":"innistrad","importance":"minor","page":"stories/dusk-reborn-2021-10-01","order":760,"story_date":"2021-10-01","storyline":"Innistrad: Crimson Vow","source":"wizards","paragraph":55,"quote":"They found the gutted remains of Olutio first","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/dusk-reborn-2021-10-01#:~:text=They%20found%20the%20gutted%20remains%20of%20Olutio%20first","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Dusk Reborn","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Rhiannon Rasmussen"],"date":"2021-10-01","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/dusk-reborn-2021-10-01","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/dusk-reborn-2021-10-01#:~:text=They%20found%20the%20gutted%20remains%20of%20Olutio%20first","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Dusk Reborn\" by Rhiannon Rasmussen. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 1 Oct 2021."}},{"id":"dusk-reborn-2021-10-01-e8","era":null,"summary":"The Buried Lord devours Sruta in front of them and greets Liesa as an old friend.","participants":["the-buried-lord","sruta","liesa","algli"],"location":"innistrad","importance":"major","page":"stories/dusk-reborn-2021-10-01","order":760,"story_date":"2021-10-01","storyline":"Innistrad: Crimson Vow","source":"wizards","paragraph":67,"quote":"On the last word his teeth sunk into Sruta, snuffing her screams with a gruesome tear.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/dusk-reborn-2021-10-01#:~:text=On%20the%20last%20word,with%20a%20gruesome%20tear.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Dusk Reborn","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Rhiannon Rasmussen"],"date":"2021-10-01","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/dusk-reborn-2021-10-01","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/dusk-reborn-2021-10-01#:~:text=On%20the%20last%20word,with%20a%20gruesome%20tear.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Dusk Reborn\" by Rhiannon Rasmussen. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 1 Oct 2021."}},{"id":"dusk-reborn-2021-10-01-e9","era":null,"summary":"The Buried Lord offers Liesa an alliance if she hands over Algli, and she refuses.","participants":["the-buried-lord","liesa","algli"],"location":"innistrad","importance":"major","page":"stories/dusk-reborn-2021-10-01","order":760,"story_date":"2021-10-01","storyline":"Innistrad: Crimson Vow","source":"wizards","paragraph":73,"quote":"\"Give me the third, and she will be my last.\"","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/dusk-reborn-2021-10-01#:~:text=%22Give%20me%20the%20third%2C,will%20be%20my%20last.%22","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Dusk Reborn","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Rhiannon Rasmussen"],"date":"2021-10-01","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/dusk-reborn-2021-10-01","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/dusk-reborn-2021-10-01#:~:text=%22Give%20me%20the%20third%2C,will%20be%20my%20last.%22","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Dusk Reborn\" by Rhiannon Rasmussen. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 1 Oct 2021."}},{"id":"dusk-reborn-2021-10-01-e10","era":null,"summary":"Liesa drives her spear into the Buried Lord's spine and he vanishes, but then he erupts from the ground and seizes Algli.","participants":["liesa","the-buried-lord","algli"],"location":"innistrad","importance":"major","page":"stories/dusk-reborn-2021-10-01","order":760,"story_date":"2021-10-01","storyline":"Innistrad: Crimson Vow","source":"wizards","paragraph":78,"quote":"Liesa drove the spear deep into the demon's spine.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/dusk-reborn-2021-10-01#:~:text=Liesa%20drove%20the%20spear,into%20the%20demon%27s%20spine.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Dusk Reborn","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Rhiannon Rasmussen"],"date":"2021-10-01","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/dusk-reborn-2021-10-01","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/dusk-reborn-2021-10-01#:~:text=Liesa%20drove%20the%20spear,into%20the%20demon%27s%20spine.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Dusk Reborn\" by Rhiannon Rasmussen. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 1 Oct 2021."}},{"id":"dusk-reborn-2021-10-01-e11","era":null,"summary":"Algli chants the old rites and feeds the Buried Lord's strength; Liesa orders her to fall silent.","participants":["algli","the-buried-lord","liesa"],"location":"innistrad","importance":"minor","page":"stories/dusk-reborn-2021-10-01","order":760,"story_date":"2021-10-01","storyline":"Innistrad: Crimson Vow","source":"wizards","paragraph":85,"quote":"As the cultist chanted, the darkness soaked into the demon.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/dusk-reborn-2021-10-01#:~:text=As%20the%20cultist%20chanted%2C,soaked%20into%20the%20demon.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Dusk Reborn","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Rhiannon Rasmussen"],"date":"2021-10-01","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/dusk-reborn-2021-10-01","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/dusk-reborn-2021-10-01#:~:text=As%20the%20cultist%20chanted%2C,soaked%20into%20the%20demon.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Dusk Reborn\" by Rhiannon Rasmussen. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 1 Oct 2021."}},{"id":"dusk-reborn-2021-10-01-e12","era":null,"summary":"Algli offers her life and thrusts her torch into the Buried Lord's mouth, and Liesa channels the fire and hope through her spear to behead him.","participants":["algli","liesa","the-buried-lord"],"location":"innistrad","importance":"major","page":"stories/dusk-reborn-2021-10-01","order":760,"story_date":"2021-10-01","storyline":"Innistrad: Crimson Vow","source":"wizards","paragraph":91,"quote":"With both hands, Algli thrust her torch into the roof of the Buried Lord's gaping maw.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/dusk-reborn-2021-10-01#:~:text=With%20both%20hands%2C%20Algli,Buried%20Lord%27s%20gaping%20maw.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Dusk Reborn","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Rhiannon Rasmussen"],"date":"2021-10-01","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/dusk-reborn-2021-10-01","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/dusk-reborn-2021-10-01#:~:text=With%20both%20hands%2C%20Algli,Buried%20Lord%27s%20gaping%20maw.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Dusk Reborn\" by Rhiannon Rasmussen. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 1 Oct 2021."}},{"id":"dusk-reborn-2021-10-01-e14","era":null,"summary":"Algli offers to forge the Buried Lord's remains into Liesa's armor and to serve her; Liesa asks for an alliance instead and Algli swears to be her ally.","participants":["algli","liesa"],"location":"innistrad","importance":"major","page":"stories/dusk-reborn-2021-10-01","order":760,"